    # Subject to: 2x₁ + 4x₂ + 7x₃ + 6x₄ + 2x₅ + 4x₆ ≤ 15
    # x_i ∈ {0, 1} for all i

    # Step 7: Nonlinear Relationships
    # No nonlinear relationships in this linear MILP

